 When counting down, Channel 2 is inactive (OC2REF=0) \

 until (CNT greater-than-or-equal CCR2), otherwise Channel 2 is active (OC2REF=1).</description>
                                    <value>6</value>
                                </enumeratedValue>
                                <enumeratedValue>
                                    <name>PWM2</name>
